>> servings: 1

Bring #small pot{} of water to boil.

Gently add @eggs{2}. Boil for 6 minutes 45 seconds.

Toast @Wooloworths Berliner Landbrot Bread{2%slice}.

Spread @full cream plain cottage cheese{25%g}

Once eggs are done boiling, drain hot water immediately and rest in cold water for a few moments.

Peel eggs and smash on toast.
